  "description": "Turn up the volume on your designs with Boogie Blast, a vibrant retro graffiti font. This typeface celebrates the expressive energy of 90s street art, featuring bouncy, 3D layered letterforms and authentic “dripping” character styles. Its heavy visual weight and rhythmic, bubbly silhouette make it an extraordinary choice for streetwear branding, urban music posters, skate-culture graphics, and standout social media content. Boogie Blast offers incredible versatility with its Regular, Extrude, and Hollow styles, ensuring your message carries a legendary and unyielding personality in every “throw-up” or piece.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Turn up the volume on your designs with Boogie Blast, a vibrant retro graffiti font. This typeface celebrates the expressive energy of 90s street art, featuring bouncy, 3D layered letterforms and authentic “dripping” character styles. Its heavy visual weight and rhythmic, bubbly silhouette make it an extraordinary choice for streetwear branding, urban music posters, skate-culture graphics, and standout social media content. Boogie Blast offers incredible versatility with its Regular, Extrude, and Hollow styles, ensuring your message carries a legendary and unyielding personality in every “throw-up” or piece.</p>",
